prefix detroit https://detroitmi.gov/zoning/
class ControlledUseProposal
class ZoningDistrict
class NeighborhoodShoppingCenter
class CommercialEstablishment
class ImprovementFinding
class PlanningDirector
property located_in_district domain ControlledUseProposal range ZoningDistrict
property located_in_center domain ControlledUseProposal range NeighborhoodShoppingCenter
property establishment_in domain CommercialEstablishment range NeighborhoodShoppingCenter
property finding_for domain ImprovementFinding range ControlledUseProposal
property determined_and_documented_by domain ImprovementFinding range PlanningDirector
datatype usable_retail_area domain NeighborhoodShoppingCenter range Area
datatype gross_floor_area domain NeighborhoodShoppingCenter range Area
datatype private_off_street_parking_spaces domain NeighborhoodShoppingCenter range nonNegativeInteger
predicate permitted_by_right domain ControlledUseProposal target ZoningDistrict
predicate conditionally_permitted domain ControlledUseProposal target ZoningDistrict
predicate only_controlled_use_in_center domain ControlledUseProposal target NeighborhoodShoppingCenter
